# Memnara environment template

Copy to `.env` locally. Do not commit `.env`.

```text
# Canonical paths.
MEMNARA_ROOT=D:\Memnara
MEMNARA_DATA=D:\Memnara-Data
MEMNARA_ROM_PATH=D:\Memnara_Roms\reference.gb
MEMNARA_PYBOY_WINDOW=null
OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434
MEMNARA_OLLAMA_HOST=http://127.0.0.1:11434
MEMNARA_MODEL=qwen3-vl:8b
MEMNARA_VISION_SCALE=3
```

Ollama model storage is owned by the Ollama server process. Do not set `OLLAMA_MODELS` as a Memnara client setting.

Never point any Memnara process at `E:\AI\.ollama\models` (Project Misty).
